<human_speech><green>This adversary is not in the catalogue. It came out of the evolution cluster.<\green><blue>It looks at where your ships are. If you send a fleet away and leave a sub thin, it will notice, and it will take the sub.<\blue><green>It is not fast. It is patient. It judges by what it sees right now.<\green><blue>So: what does it see, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>? And what would you like it to see instead?<\blue><green>Note that down.<\green><\human_speech>
